<title>UK: Wheat carrier under tow to Rotterdam.</title>
<headline>Wheat carrier under tow to Rotterdam.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus-flag bulk carrier Star Peter is being towed to Rotterdam after sustaining rudder problems, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 52,327 dwt ship had been heading from Baie Comeau, Canada, to Rotterdam with a cargo of wheat.</p>
